def remove_duplicates_sorted(arr: list[int]) -> int:
    """Remove duplicates from sorted array in-place, O(1) space."""
    if not arr:
        return 0
    write = 1
    for read in range(1, len(arr)):
        if arr[read] != arr[write - 1]:
            arr[write] = arr[read]
            write += 1
    return write
```
Two-pointer technique keeps space constant.

