def remove_evens(nums: list[int]) -> list[int]:
    i = 0
    while i < len(nums):
        if nums[i] % 2 == 0:
            nums.pop(i)
        else:
            i += 1
    return nums
```
Removes evens in place and returns the cleaned-up list.

